॰ letter -> its six bits, indexed by code point minus २३०८ (०x९०४) —
॰ which is the letter's Devanagari-8 octet minus १३२ (ADR-0044 D4).
॰ २५५ marks a code point the alphabet does not use; the decoder never sees one
॰ because only the generator writes this module.
